        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 15, \"total_count\": 15, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Restaurant list shows name, cuisine, price tier ($$$$), rating, location, features. Details page (restaurant/1) shows name, cuisine, address/location, price tier, description paragraph, and feature tags (Private Dining, Wine Pairing, Tasting Menu).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search by name (Sakura), cuisine (Italian), and neighborhood (Waterfront) each correctly filtered to matching restaurant. Combining cuisine=Seafood + price=$$-Moderate (which excludes Ocean Blue's $$$) correctly returned 'No restaurants found matching your criteria.'\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Booked Trattoria Bella for Aug 26, 2026 at 19:00, 6 guests, with name/email/phone supplied. 'Reservation Confirmed!' toast and modal appeared; reservation now appears under Upcoming (1) with restaurant, date, time, party size, location matching submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked Cancel on the upcoming Trattoria Bella reservation; a confirmation dialog appeared ('Cancel Reservation?'). Confirming showed 'Reservation Cancelled' toast, removed it from Upcoming (now 0), and it now appears in Past (1) tab with status 'Cancelled' and full details retained (date, time, party size, location, coupon).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On restaurant/3, submitted a review with 4-star rating, name 'TestReviewerNoRes', visit date 2026-08-01, and review text. Success toast 'Review Submitted!' appeared, review count went from (1) to (2), and the new review appears in the Reviews tab exclusively for this restaurant while restaurant/1's reviews (Sarah M., James L.) remained unaffected.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"During reservation creation, applied coupon GROUP15 (saw '15% off for parties of 6 or more' confirmation), removed it, then reapplied it before submitting. The confirmed reservation in Upcoming list displays 'Coupon applied: GROUP15', confirming it was recorded with the reservation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker on restaurant/3 disabled all dates in the past and on/before today (Aug 24, 2026 and earlier all shown [disabled]), while Aug 25 onward were selectable. Selected Aug 26, 2026 successfully, then the time dropdown offered available slots (11:30-20:30) and 19:00 was selected without error.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation modification dialog does not support changing the date\", \"actual\": \"Clicking 'Modify' on an upcoming reservation opens a 'Modify Reservation' dialog offering only 'New Time' and 'Party Size' fields; there is no date field/control. Time was successfully changed from 19:00 to 18:00 and party size from 6 to 4, and these persisted in the Upcoming list, but the date (Aug 26, 2026) cannot be modified through this dialog.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing constraint enforcement: review submission not gated by completed reservation\", \"actual\": \"On restaurant/3 (Trattoria Bella), with zero reservations ever made for this restaurant/user, the 'Write a Review' form accepted and successfully submitted a review (name 'TestReviewerNoRes', rating 4, review text) with no validation against any completed reservation. Review count increased from (1) to (2) immediately, confirming the review was accepted despite no completed reservation existing at all.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon eligibility rules (day-of-week and first-reservation) not enforced; only party-size rule enforced\", \"actual\": \"Party-size rule works correctly: GROUP15 (requires 6+ guests) was rejected with 'This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.' when party size was 2, and accepted at 6 guests. However, WEEKEND20 ('20% off weekend dining') was accepted on Wednesday Aug 26, 2026, a non-weekend date, violating the day-of-week eligibility condition. Also, WELCOME10 ('10% off your first reservation') was accepted for a booking attempt on restaurant/4 even though the user already had a confirmed reservation (Trattoria Bella, Aug 26 2026) from earlier in the session, violating the first-reservation-only eligibility condition. The UI does correctly prevent applying more than one coupon at a time (coupon input is replaced by a single applied-coupon chip with remove button).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the reservation form with empty Name/Email/Phone triggers HTML5 required validation ('Please fill out this field.') and blocks submission (focus moves to first invalid field, no reservation created). Submitting with invalid email 'not-an-email' triggers type=email validation: \\\\\\\"Please include an '@' in the email address...\\\\\\\" and blocks submission until corrected.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify button opened a dialog with editable Time/Party Size and a Save Changes button that persisted changes immediately. Cancel button opened an explicit confirmation alertdialog ('Cancel Reservation? ... This action cannot be undone') with 'Keep Reservation' / 'Cancel Reservation' options; cancellation only took effect after explicitly confirming.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Creating a reservation showed a 'Reservation Confirmed!' toast+modal and the new entry appeared instantly in Upcoming (1) without reload. Applying/removing a coupon showed immediate toast feedback and UI update. Modifying a reservation showed a 'Reservation Updated' toast and the Upcoming list immediately reflected new time (18:00) and party size (4 Guests) in the same session.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Upcoming tab (before cancellation) showed status badge 'Upcoming' with restaurant, date, time, party size, location, and coupon. Past tab shows the same reservation with status badge changed to 'Cancelled', clearly distinguishing it from upcoming reservations, and retaining all details: restaurant (Trattoria Bella), date (Aug 26 2026), time (18:00), party size (4 Guests), location (Little Italy), and applied coupon (GROUP15).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating/review-count inconsistency between restaurant list and details page; list rating not updated after new review\", \"actual\": \"Restaurant list page shows Trattoria Bella at 4.5 rating (no review count), while its details page shows 4.0 (2) after reviews. Even after submitting a new review that changed the details page from 4.0 (1) to 4.0 (2), the list page still displayed the static 4.5 unchanged. Same mismatch observed for The Golden Fork: list=4.8, details=4.5 (2).\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
